#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:117
#: b18063b345db42928f1eaeeb02f369b0
msgid "3 of the 4 ports provide 3.3V power on **pin1**, while the **/dev/tty-1** provides 5V power (note that **pin6** is not ground, unlike on a Pixhawk). You will need to check whether your GPS can be powered off 3.3V. A uBlox GPS is recommended, although any ArduPilot compatible serial GPS can be used."
msgstr ""

